# GI-SHADE-DARK: under SoftwareTraced GI the shade of Bistro's street must not be darker than with GI Off. UE Lumen:
# the sky reaches the shade through the traced rays' misses (and the bounce), so a shaded street is never darker than
# the GI-less skylight ambient. FIELD_Barn (on SoftwareTraced since 941628e4a): tree shadows carry the sky's colour.
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/B16_Bistro_Street.desce
Дано run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method SoftwareTraced"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -440,300,-230
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Тогда-вид 1_bistro_sw the street's shade under SoftwareTraced GI: not darker than 2_bistro_off (mean shade luminance)
Когда run View "View mode: Indirect Lighting (GI)"
Тогда-вид 1b_bistro_sw_indirect the traced indirect alone: the shade carries the sky
Когда run View "View mode: Lumen Scene (Lit)"
Тогда-вид 1c_bistro_lumen_lit the surface cache's lit cards: shaded walls not black
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Off"
Тогда-вид 2_bistro_off the same street without GI: the skylight ambient reference
Когда run View "View mode: Indirect Lighting (GI)"
Тогда-вид 2b_bistro_off_indirect the skylight ambient alone (GI Off)
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Level"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Entity "Sun"
Когда --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Когда --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 3_field the field on dev's GI (SoftwareTraced): tree shadows carry the sky's colour, not black
